pporting these  centric cult unit with a defined  atmosphere so co2  for example five percent co2 10 co2  whatever the cultivation  requires there's visual cell examination  possible by an integrated microscope the  microscope is also part of the clinimax  prodigy and we have multiple input ports  for different  media or cytokines of course these 100  square centimeters might not to be  sufficient for different for all the  different applications  especially for the msc workflow um  it is not sufficient so therefore here  customers have the possibility to  connect an external culture weather to  the tubing set  and then it's possible to have a  scalable fan manufacturing process  now coming to the tubing set it's gmp  compliant  and it's possible to do sterile welding  during the process  it has integrated several bags and  sample pouches  for passaging and qc  it's easy to connect an external  cultivation weather as  it is shown here via the dead end tube  and you cannot only connect one  for example cell stack to these dead end  you can  also connect up to three cell stacks  the five layer cell stacks for example  the whole tubing set is compatible with  the upcoming clinimax electroporator  for gene manipulation  so showing now here in more detail the  gmp compliant msc expansion workflow  using the clinimax prodigy adherent cell  culture  system so everything starts again also  here with the bone marrow  and the whole process then is automated  within the machine  so having the density gradient  centrifugation  seeding of cells  media change harvesting  and seeding again in different cell  culture  external cell culture vessels up to  the last harvest of the target cells  so the process is quite um handy  and quite optimized  to reduce the manual hands-on time  so here within this process we have  reduced the hands-on  time to about 70 percent  the process is not only available  for bone marrow to isolate ms from bone  marrow but also  you can do this with enzym